{"server":"cn","storyId":"act36side_level_act36side_07_beg","groupId":"act36side","stageId":"act36side_07","title":"健康零食","storyCode":"DT-7","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"1b341d4d6cb59143c347862dbd4384df8e3ebbe51dedf2788743c51aba38bc4b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"误以为被袭击的莱欧斯小队、认为莱欧斯小队要抢劫的拓荒者们，和碰巧来此执行任务的罗德岛干员，三方人因为一群失控的无人机，被卷进同一场混乱中。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？为什么这里的魔法器具追着我们打？我们被谁盯上了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剑够不到它们，和之前对魔物的战斗都不一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛露西尔！你用魔法啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我被炸到了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳！能施展爆炸魔法和冰冻魔法，还能这么精准地定位，这种魔法器具非常高级......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们动作太快了，很难瞄准......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎么办！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......先跑！它们施魔法我就用魔法对冲！看看能不能跑出它们的攻击范围！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——那边好像有村庄！这些东西也都是从那里飞出来的，这次遇到的人对我们很不友好啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛露西尔！小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——我看到它们的轨迹了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我......回去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"炸弹被玛露西尔施展的魔法击飞，向着发射出它的无人机处飞去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"无人机被炸弹击中，摇摇晃晃地掉落。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一声巨大的炸响，建筑冒出火光，随即响起的是村庄中人们大呼小叫的声音。魔法器具随着刚刚的爆炸，更加狂乱地冲向几人。\n玛露西尔不禁握紧了手中的法杖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱欧斯，我们现在好像真的惹怒他们了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"森西，玛露西尔，是时候该认真迎战了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜......还是没找到罗德岛的消息......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，天灾居然没有毁掉我们的玉米地！这里也没有被沙尘暴侵袭，都好好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这几天我一直担惊受怕的，玉米地要是没了我们下半年可就没的吃也没的卖了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，那我先去启动无人机了？别的地方运气可能没我们这么好，要是发现了我们这里一点没受损肯定会来抢的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，记得调一下模式，别巡逻了，直接就是战斗模式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，记得接一下那个罗德岛的干员，他今天灾后回访！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？不对啊......基站怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......无人机怎么也完全不听指挥......？信号......老大，老大！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——天、天灾砸到了基站！无人机......失控了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别慌！先把基站停了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"关不掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*哥伦比亚俚语*！那你自己想办法啊！养你吃干饭的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！呃、呃，源石回路......主线板......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛外勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——你们这什么情况？！这么不欢迎我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，不是！小锤子瑞恩，我记得你！你帮帮我，无人机失控了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？你躲着点，我来帮你看看......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——谁？真有人来趁乱抢劫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干他们！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，任务记录，这里是瑞恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"首先是接回刻俄柏。呃......这个任务的难度有点高，情报显示这孩子最后出现在这一带，但是找起来可不简单......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，今天也是灾后回访的第一天，去“玉米窝”看一下情况，希望一切顺......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"什么情况？！拓荒地打起来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！呃、呃，源石回路......主线板......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"（......没看到外人？是他们自己内部出了问题？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"（先试探下吧......这群人都不是什么好惹的......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——你们这什么情况？！这么不欢迎我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，不是！小锤子瑞恩，我记得你！你帮帮我，无人机失控了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼......还好，只是无人机失控，要是拓荒地乱了我肯定就交待在这里了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？你躲着点，我来帮你看看......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"唔咳咳咳咳咳！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"（坏了，真是外面的拓荒者动手了！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——谁？真有人来趁乱抢劫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干他们！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，我在这要是被当成罗德岛参与拓荒地纷争可就完了，先、先保护住他们，最好能调节一下矛盾——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"大哥别冲动！对面多少人还不知道，咱们先找掩体躲起来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*粗口*老子都看到了，就四个人！其中还有两个矮子，打他们！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冲啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"别——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？就四个人？这什么打劫组合？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......两拨人？小心点，他们手里都拿着武器，还有那种玛露西尔都没法对付的魔法器具，不要轻举妄动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"气死我了！我的头发都被炸乱了！我很喜欢这个编法的啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*粗口*以为老子是好惹的吗？就四个人也敢炸我的粮仓？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"不！等等！几位有话好好说！无人机还在天上乱飞，真的要现在就打起来吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放屁！老子自己的无人机，还能把老子打死不成？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明是他们什么都不说，单方面地攻击我们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敢来炸我的粮仓，找死——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们动手了，保护好自己，上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，这些魔法器具都是他们操控的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哟......哎哟......都是祖宗，都劝不动啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"在荒野上打架不知道会引来什么啊，大家先停下来，有话好好说不好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"仿佛是脚下的大地在这一刻听到了他诚恳的祈求一般，地面突然发出剧烈的轰鸣。\n难道又是天灾？这个念头刚在几人的脑中出现，随即又被接下来的景象彻底击碎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一大群如浪潮般的钳兽似乎是终于不想再忍受无人机在自己的头顶狂轰滥炸，齐齐高举着自己的双钳，直向众人而来——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——魔物群？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快跑！就我们四个打不过的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没、没有路了！它们把我们包围起来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先往后退......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——哎呀！谁不长眼撞老子？！老子一锤子——怎么是你们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，没有路了，我们都被这群钳兽包围了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"几位，求求了，听我的吧，我们先一起干它们，好不好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑞恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"还、还有无人机！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
